# 🔴 THE VENDORED OMG BPMN SCHEMA SET IS BYTE-PINNED, SO GIT MUST NOT TOUCH IT.
# The five files ship with CRLF endings exactly as omg.org serves them, and
# `* text=auto eol=lf` above would rewrite every line on checkout: the files on
# disk would then no longer hash to the SHA-256 sums recorded in
# schema/PROVENANCE.md, which is both a failing provenance test and, more to
# the point, a modified copy of a specification we said we had not modified.
lib/Service/Flow/Bpmn/schema/*.xsd -text

.github export-ignore
.travis.yml export-ignore
LICENSE export-ignore
README.md export-ignore
